bottomparticipants

actor "Content Moderator" as MOD
boundary "Manga Management UI" as UI
boundary "Router" as RT
control "MangaController" as CT
control "MangaService" as SV

MOD -> UI: 1. Open Manga Management
activate MOD
activate UI

UI -> RT: 2. GET /api/manga/admin/management
activate RT

ref over RT : 3.119.b.i. Subsequence - Check auth and moderator role

alt Unauthorized
  RT --> UI: 3.1.1. HTTP 401
  UI --> MOD: 3.1.2. Show login required
else Permission denied
  RT --> UI: 3.2.1. HTTP 403
  UI --> MOD: 3.2.2. Show permission denied
end
  RT -> CT: 4. getManagementList(query)
  activate CT

  CT -> SV: 5. getManagementList(query)
  activate SV

  ref over SV, MongoDB: 3.119.b.ii. Subsequence - Query list and stats

  SV --> CT: 7. Management list response
  deactivate SV

  CT --> RT: 8. HTTP 200
  deactivate CT

  RT --> UI: 9. Return list + stats

deactivate RT

UI -> UI: 10. Check data
activate UI
space
deactivate UI

opt No manga found
  UI --> MOD: 10.1 Show empty state
end

UI --> MOD: 11. Show table, filters, stats
deactivate UI
deactivate MOD
@enduml